    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 032 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Outgoing Person"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I am very outgoing, so I like to do many things with other people."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Because of this, I have many friends."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Their names are Dai-han (대한) and Min-guk(민국)."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Who is my best friend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My best friend is Dai-han, and I have known him for 3 years."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "What is he like? He is like me in many ways."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He is an outgoing but sometimes shy person like me."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He likes to hang out and play with friends, but he does not"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "like to talk to new people. I am like this, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
        "2 번",
        "3 번",
        "4 번",
        "5 번"
      ]
